OL,3,AI earn #30,000. I'm angry there was no
OL,4,Afuel duty cut in the Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has unveiled his
OL,7,Ffirst Budget.
OL,9,FHe announced #100 energy payment for
OL,10,Fmillions and a tax rise on banks, among
OL,11,Fother measures.
OL,13,FBBC News has been speaking to people on
OL,14,Fa range of incomes on how they feel
OL,15,Fabout their finances and how the Budget
OL,16,Faffects them.
OL,18,FDave Herbert is a professional driver
OL,19,Fon #30,000 a year. He moves cars
OL,20,Fbetween showrooms and does deliveries
OL,21,Fand says fuel prices have been "crazy"
OL,22,Fthis year.
